  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:330px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-dimgray pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Mass Regeneration</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/Bio_Utilities.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200512073305\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bio Utilities\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/Bio_Utilities.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200512073305\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/Bio_Utilities.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20200512073305 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/Bio_Utilities.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20200512073305 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bio Utilities\" width=\"210\" height=\"500\" data-image-key=\"Bio_Utilities.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Bio Utilities.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Quantum Bio-Belts (DC Comics) can have a restorative effect upon individuals with damaged or missing bodily mass.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Channel physical mass for regeneration.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>transfer and repurpose bodies of mass for physical restoration.</b> Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Transference\" title=\"Mass Transference\">Mass Transference</a>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Manipulation\" title=\"Mass Manipulation\">Mass Manipulation</a>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Bodily_Mass_Manipulation\" title=\"Bodily Mass Manipulation\">Bodily Mass Manipulation</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Absorption\" title=\"Mass Absorption\">Mass Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Known_Items\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Items</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMass_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Mass Assimilation</li>\n<li>Mass Redistribution</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMass_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb mass in order to heal and augment oneself or others. Able to regrow lost limbs, damaged organs and the like using excess mass from another source. Transferring it from its point of origin into another body of matter while wearying and/or downsizing that which they siphoned it from. This can also result in the temporary strengthening or enlargement of affected anatomy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMass_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Accelerating_Regeneration\" title=\"Accelerating Regeneration\">Accelerating Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Molecular_Structure_Absorption\" title=\"Molecular Structure Absorption\">Molecular Structure Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mimetic_Regeneration\" title=\"Mimetic Regeneration\">Mimetic Regeneration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Redistribution\" title=\"Matter Redistribution\">Matter Redistribution</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Conversion\" title=\"Mass Conversion\">Mass Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Transference\" title=\"Mass Transference\">Mass Transference</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Reduction\" title=\"Mass Reduction\">Mass Reduction</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Magnification\" title=\"Mass Magnification\">Mass Magnification</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Size_Manipulation\" title=\"Size Manipulation\">Size Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Limb_Extension\" title=\"Limb Extension\">Limb Extension</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Limb_Expansion\" title=\"Limb Expansion\">Expansion</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Transmutation\" title=\"Organic Transmutation\">Organic</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Inorganic_Transmutation\" title=\"Inorganic Transmutation\">Inorganic Transmutation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Flesh_Transmutation\" title=\"Flesh Transmutation\">Flesh Transmutation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Flesh_Transfusion\" title=\"Flesh Transfusion\">Flesh Transfusion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\">Healing</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Regrowth\" title=\"Regrowth\">Regrowth</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Limb_Regrowth\" title=\"Limb Regrowth\">Limb Regrowth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Unnatural_Limb_Regrowth\" title=\"Unnatural Limb Regrowth\">Unnatural Limb Regrowth</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Structure_Weakening\" title=\"Structure Weakening\">Structure Weakening</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Structure_Strengthening\" title=\"Structure Strengthening\">Strengthening</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMass_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMass_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Manipulation\" title=\"Mass Manipulation\">Mass Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mass_Absorption\" title=\"Mass Absorption\">Mass Absorption</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMass_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May require a direct link to drain Mass from.\n<ul><li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Certain mass donors may not graft well.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMass_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Ryan Choi/The Atom (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Crystal Altar (<i>S-Cry-Ed</i>)</li>\n<li>Kazuma (<i>S-Cry-Ed</i>)</li>\n<li>Ryuoh (<i>S-Cry-Ed</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Items\">Known Items</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMass_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Quantum Bio-Belts (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260806034811\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 127/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argum